{
  "projects": {
    "demo": {
      "stage": {
        "actions": [
          "read"
        ],
        "min_role": "student"
      },
      "data": {
        "actions": [
          "read"
        ],
        "min_role": "student"
      },
      "admin": {
        "actions": [
          "manage"
        ],
        "min_role": "admin",
        "env": {
          "deny_when": [
            {
              "fact": "hour",
              "not_in": [
                9,
                18
              ],
              "reason": "no-admin-actions-outside-business-hours"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "stage_resource": {
    "demo": "stage"
  },
  "comment": "演示用资源表：资源 -> 允许动作 + 最低角色 + 可选 env 规则。引擎按 (user, res, action, stage, env) 决策：role 门槛、学段白名单，以及 env 段声明的运行期事实（这里 admin 资源禁止 9-18 点之外的管理操作）。stage_resource 指定哪个资源走学段白名单检查。改完即时生效，不用重建镜像。"
}
